{"title":"2. 进程、线程的对比","uid":"499de2abc49de0c5b364348e41a24fd7","slug":"进程与内存/2. 进程、线程的对比","date":"2025-04-04T15:46:30.000Z","updated":"2025-04-04T10:45:43.032Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/进程与内存/2. 进程、线程的对比.json","keywords":null,"cover":"../../images/linux/04.png","content":"<h2 id=\"进程、线程定义\"><a href=\"#进程、线程定义\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"进程、线程定义\"></a>进程、线程定义</h2><hr>\n<blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>在Linux中进程与线程的相同点要远远大于不同点。在操作系统的理论中，进程和线程分别使用进程控制块PCB和线程控制块TCB来表示的。但其实在linux的视线里，无论是进程还是线程，都抽象成了任务，在源码里使用<code>task_struct</code>结构来实现</p></blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"/../../images/linux/04.png\" alt=\"04.png\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"进程、线程状态\"><a href=\"#进程、线程状态\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"进程、线程状态\"></a>进程、线程状态</h3><blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>进程、线程都是有状态的，它的状态就保存在<code>state</code>字段中</p></blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"/../../images/linux/05.png\" alt=\"05.png\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"进程ID与线程ID\"><a href=\"#进程ID与线程ID\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"进程ID与线程ID\"></a>进程ID与线程ID</h3><ul>\n<li><code>pid</code>是linux为了标识每一个进程而分配给它的唯一号码，称作进行ID，简称PID。对于没有创建线程的进程（只包含一个主线程），这个pid就是进程的PID，<code>tgid</code>和<code>pid</code>是相同的</li>\n<li>从内核的角度看，用户态的线程本质上还是一个进程。只不过和普通线程的区别是会和<code>父进程共享</code>虚拟地址空间等数据结构，会更轻量一些，所以在linux下的线程也叫轻量级线程。</li>\n<li>假如一个进程下创建了多个线程，<code>每个线程的pid都是不一样的</code>，这是内核唯一标识他们的地方，所以必须不一致。他们通过<code>tgid</code>字段来表示自己所属的进程ID。</li>\n<li>对于用户程序来说，调用<code>getpid()</code>函数其实返回的是<code>tgid</code>，这样无论进程还是线程获取到的进程id看起来都符合我们的预期了</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"进程ID与线程ID-1\"><a href=\"#进程ID与线程ID-1\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"进程ID与线程ID\"></a>进程ID与线程ID</h3><blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>Linux下所有的进程都是通过一棵树来管理的。在操作系统启动的时候，会创建<code>init</code>进程，接下来所有的进程都是由这个进程直接或者间接创建的。通过<code>pstree</code>命令可以查看当前服务器上的进程树信息。</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"进程调度优先级\"><a href=\"#进程调度优先级\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"进程调度优先级\"></a>进程调度优先级</h3><blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>Linux中的调度，主要分实时进程调度和普通进程调度</p></blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>普通进程采用的调度器是CFS(Completely Fair Scheduler，完全公平调度器)</li>\n<li>实时进程调度: 高优先级实时进程可抢占低优先级</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"进程地址空间\"><a href=\"#进程地址空间\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"进程地址空间\"></a>进程地址空间</h3><blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>对于用户进程来说，<code>mm_struct</code>（mm代表的是memory descriptor，内存描述符）是非常核心的数据结构，整个进程的<code>虚拟地址空间部分</code>都是由它来表示的。进程在运行的时候，在用户态其所需要的内存数据，如代码、全局变量数据及 mmap 内存映射等都是通过mm_struct进行内存查找和寻址的。</p></blockquote>\n","feature":true,"text":"进程、线程定义 在Linux中进程与线程的相同点要远远大于不同点。在操作系统的理论中，进程和线程分别使用进程控制块PCB和线程控制块TCB来表示的。但其实在li...","permalink":"/post/进程与内存/2. 进程、线程的对比","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":910,"symbolsTime":"1 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"深入理解Linux进程与内存","slug":"深入理解Linux进程与内存","count":2,"path":"api/categories/深入理解Linux进程与内存.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"深入理解Linux进程与内存","slug":"深入理解Linux进程与内存","count":2,"path":"api/tags/深入理解Linux进程与内存.json"},{"name":"进程","slug":"进程","count":1,"path":"api/tags/进程.json"},{"name":"线程","slug":"线程","count":1,"path":"api/tags/线程.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E8%BF%9B%E7%A8%8B%E3%80%81%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89\"><span class=\"toc-text\">进程、线程定义</span></a><ol class=\"toc-child\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E8%BF%9B%E7%A8%8B%E3%80%81%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8B%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81\"><span class=\"toc-text\">进程、线程状态</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E8%BF%9B%E7%A8%8BID%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8BID\"><span class=\"toc-text\">进程ID与线程ID</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E8%BF%9B%E7%A8%8BID%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8BID-1\"><span class=\"toc-text\">进程ID与线程ID</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E8%BF%9B%E7%A8%8B%E8%B0%83%E5%BA%A6%E4%BC%98%E5%85%88%E7%BA%A7\"><span class=\"toc-text\">进程调度优先级</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E8%BF%9B%E7%A8%8B%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4\"><span class=\"toc-text\">进程地址空间</span></a></li></ol></li></ol>","author":{"name":"WU LEI","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/images/avatar.jpg","link":"/","description":"Code & Life <br> 道阻且长，行则将至","socials":{"github":"https://github.com/taeyang0126","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu":"","csdn":"","juejin":"","customs":{}}},"mapped":true,"hidden":false,"prev_post":{},"next_post":{"title":"1. CPU硬件原理","uid":"d0ed7c10c84d02589cbcd0dda670787a","slug":"进程与内存/1. CPU与内存硬件原理","date":"2025-04-01T17:46:30.000Z","updated":"2025-04-04T10:45:43.032Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/进程与内存/1. CPU与内存硬件原理.json","keywords":null,"cover":"../../images/linux/01.png","text":"CPU 硬件原理 cpu 工作频率是多少 通过 /proc/cpuinfo 命令查看 1cat /proc/cpuinfo | grep -i \"MHz\" 物理...","permalink":"/post/进程与内存/1. CPU与内存硬件原理","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"5.8k","symbolsTime":"5 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"深入理解Linux进程与内存","slug":"深入理解Linux进程与内存","count":2,"path":"api/categories/深入理解Linux进程与内存.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"深入理解Linux进程与内存","slug":"深入理解Linux进程与内存","count":2,"path":"api/tags/深入理解Linux进程与内存.json"},{"name":"硬件","slug":"硬件","count":1,"path":"api/tags/硬件.json"},{"name":"CPU","slug":"CPU","count":1,"path":"api/tags/CPU.json"}],"author":{"name":"WU LEI","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/images/avatar.jpg","link":"/","description":"Code & Life <br> 道阻且长，行则将至","socials":{"github":"https://github.com/taeyang0126","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu":"","csdn":"","juejin":"","customs":{}}},"feature":true}}